= Mūla Vinaya Piṭaka Pācittiyapāḷi
Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa

Vinayapiṭake Pācittiyapāḷi

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 5)
+ Pācittiyakaṇḍaṃ
