vasimhi; ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo sacchikato mayā''ti bhaṇantassa āpatti
pācittiyassa.

Āroceyyāti anupasampannassa -- ‘‘sotāpattiphalaṃ… sakadāgāmiphalaṃ…
anāgāmiphalaṃ… arahattaṃ samāpajjiṃ, samāpajjāmi, samāpanno; arahattassa
lābhimhi, vasimhi; arahattaṃ \[arahattaphalaṃ (syā.)\] sacchikataṃ
mayā''ti bhaṇantassa āpatti pācittiyassa.

Āroceyyāti anupasampannassa -- ‘‘rāgo me catto… doso me catto… moho me
catto, vanto, mutto, pahīno, paṭinissaṭṭho, ukkheṭito, samukkheṭito''ti
bhaṇantassa āpatti pācittiyassa.

Āroceyyāti anupasampannassa -- ‘‘rāgā me cittaṃ vinīvaraṇaṃ… dosā me
citta vinīvaraṇaṃ… mohā me cittaṃ vinīvaraṇa''nti bhaṇantassa āpatti
