  -- yassa sambādho bhavissati so pakkamissatīti. Ye te bhikkhū
  appicchā… pe… te ujjhāyanti khiyyanti vipācenti -- ‘‘kathañhi nāma
  chabbaggiyā bhikkhū there bhikkhū anupakhajja seyyaṃ kappessantī''ti!
  Atha kho te bhikkhū chabbaggiye bhikkhū anekapariyāyena vigarahitvā
  bhagavato etamatthaṃ ārocesuṃ …pe… ‘‘saccaṃ kira tumhe, bhikkhave,
