Atha kho chabbaggiyā bhikkhū sattarasavaggiye bhikkhū etadavocuṃ --
‘‘uṭṭhethāvuso, amhākaṃ vihāro pāpuṇātī''ti. ‘‘Nanu, āvuso, paṭikacceva
