Aggaḷaṭṭhapanāyāti dvāraṭṭhapanāya.

Ālokasandhiparikammāyāti vātapānaparikammāya setavaṇṇaṃ kāḷavaṇṇaṃ
gerukaparikammaṃ mālākammaṃ latākammaṃ makaradantakaṃ pañcapaṭikaṃ.

Dvatticchadanassa pariyāyaṃ appaharite ṭhitena adhiṭṭhātabbanti --
haritaṃ nāma pubbaṇṇaṃ aparaṇṇaṃ. Sace harite ṭhito adhiṭṭhāti, āpatti
dukkaṭassa. Maggena chādentassa dve magge adhiṭṭhahitvā tatiyaṃ maggaṃ
āṇāpetvā pakkamitabbaṃ. Pariyāyena chādentassa dve pariyāye
adhiṭṭhahitvā tatiyaṃ pariyāyaṃ āṇāpetvā pakkamitabbaṃ.

