  bhaginiyo, aṭṭha garudhammā''ti? Sace ‘‘vattantāyyā''ti bhaṇanti,
  ‘‘eso, bhaginiyo, ovādo''ti niyyādetabbo \[niyyātetabbo (itipi)\].
  Sace ‘‘na vattantāyyā''ti bhaṇanti, osāretabbā.
  ‘‘Vassasatūpasampannāya bhikkhuniyā tadahupasampannassa bhikkhuno
