‘‘Yo pana bhikkhu bhikkhuniyā saddhiṃ saṃvidhāya ekaddhānamaggaṃ
paṭipajjeyya, antamaso gāmantarampi, pācittiya''nti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 181)
+ Tena kho pana samayena sambahulā bhikkhū ca bhikkhuniyo ca sāketā
  sāvatthiṃ addhānamaggappaṭipannā honti. Atha kho tā bhikkhuniyo te
