  paṇītabhojanāni attano atthāya viññāpetvā bhuñjissanti! Kassa
  sampannaṃ na manāpaṃ, kassa sāduṃ na ruccatī''ti!! Assosuṃ kho bhikkhū
  tesaṃ manussānaṃ ujjhāyantānaṃ khiyyantānaṃ vipācentānaṃ. Ye te
  bhikkhū appicchā… pe… te ujjhāyanti khiyyanti vipācenti -- ‘‘kathañhi
  nāma chabbaggiyā bhikkhū paṇītabhojanāni attano atthāya viññāpetvā
  bhuñjissantī''ti …pe… saccaṃ kira tumhe, bhikkhave, paṇītabhojanāni
  attano atthāya viññāpetvā bhuñjathāti? ‘‘Saccaṃ, bhagavā''ti. Vigarahi
