+ ‘‘Yo pana bhikkhu mātugāmena saddhiṃ raho paṭicchanne āsane nisajjaṃ
  kappeyya, pācittiya''nti.

+ Yo panāti yo yādiso…pe… bhikkhūti…pe… ayaṃ imasmiṃ atthe adhippeto
