+ ‘‘Yo pana bhikkhu nimantito sabhatto samāno santaṃ bhikkhuṃ anāpucchā
  purebhattaṃ vā pacchābhattaṃ vā kulesu cārittaṃ āpajjeyya, aññatra
  samayā, pācittiyaṃ. Tatthāyaṃ samayo. Cīvaradānasamayo,
