khamati itthannāmassa bhikkhuno samanubhāsanā, tassā diṭṭhiyā
paṭinissaggāya, so tuṇhassa; yassa nakkhamati, so bhāseyya.

‘‘Dutiyampi etamatthaṃ vadāmi…pe… tatiyampi etamatthaṃ vadāmi --
