  bhikkhuniṃ nevattanā paṭicodesi na gaṇassa ārocesī''ti? ‘‘Yo etissā
  avaṇṇo mayheso avaṇṇo, yā etissā akitti mayhesā akitti, yo etissā
  ayaso mayheso ayaso, yo etissā alābho mayheso alābho. Kyāhaṃ, ayye,
