ce paṭinissajjati, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Sā bhikkhunī samanubhāsitabbā.
Evañca pana, bhikkhave, samanubhāsitabbā. Byattāya bhikkhuniyā
paṭibalāya saṅgho ñāpetabbo --

