#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 736)
+ Rattātikkante atikkantasaññā, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ. Rattātikkante
  vematikā, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ. Rattātikkante anatikkantasaññā,
  nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ. Anadhiṭṭhite adhiṭṭhitasaññā, nissaggiyaṃ
  pācittiyaṃ. Avikappite vikappitasaññā, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ.
  Avissajjite vissajjitasaññā, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ. Anaṭṭhe
  naṭṭhasaññā… avinaṭṭhe vinaṭṭhasaññā… abhinne bhinnasaññā… avilutte
  viluttasaññā, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyaṃ.
