  vematikā vuṭṭhāpeti, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Gabbhiniyā agabbhinisaññā
  vuṭṭhāpeti, anāpatti. Agabbhiniyā gabbhinisaññā, āpatti dukkaṭassa.
  Agabbhiniyā vematikā, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Agabbhiniyā agabbhinisaññā,
  anāpatti.

+ Anāpatti gabbhiniṃ agabbhinisaññā vuṭṭhāpeti, agabbhiniṃ
  agabbhinisaññā vuṭṭhāpeti, ummattikāya, ādikammikāyāti.
]

