appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya…pe… evañca pana, bhikkhave, bhikkhuniyo imaṃ
sikkhāpadaṃ uddisantu --

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 1225)
+ ‘‘Yā pana bhikkhunī asaṅkaccikā \[asaṅkacchikā (syā.)\] gāmaṃ
