Terasamasikkhāpadaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.

Chattupāhanavaggo navamo.

Uddiṭṭhā kho, ayyāyo, chasaṭṭhisatā pācittiyā dhammā. Tatthāyyāyo
pucchāmi -- ‘‘kaccittha parisuddhā''? Dutiyampi pucchāmi -- ‘‘kaccittha
parisuddhā''? Tatiyampi pucchāmi -- ‘‘kaccittha parisuddhā''?
Parisuddhetthāyyāyo, tasmā tuṇhī, evametaṃ dhārayāmīti.

Khuddakaṃ samattaṃ.

Bhikkhunivibhaṅge pācittiyakaṇḍaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.

